# Thought Scour: "Target player mills two cards" - any player, so in a three-player game Bot1 may aim it at Bot3 and leave Bot2
# alone (CR 115.1): Bot3's graveyard gets its top two cards, Bot2's library is untouched, and Bot1 draws a card. (The
# first player of a game of more than two draws on turn 1, CR 103.8a: Bot1 has eight cards, plays one, casts one and draws one.)

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Thought Scour
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Bot3 Deck]
Island
Island
Mountain
Mountain
Swamp
Swamp
Plains
Forest
Forest
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Thought Scour.Cast(Bot3)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot3.Pass

[Expect]
Bot3.Graveyard = Forest; Forest
Bot3.Library.Count = 10
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot1.Hand.Count = 7
